                                "type": "TextualBody",
                                "format": "text/html",
                                "value": "<p>[fol. 478r]</p><p>Die 27 Septembris 1626</p><p></p><p>Fu futta Cong<em>regration</em>e g<em>enera</em>le delli Sig.ri Pittori et Scultori<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>di Roma Nella Chiesa di S. Luca in Campo<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Vaccino do[v]e Intervennero l'Infr<em>ascritt</em>i cioe<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>L'Ill' Sig.r Simone Vuett Prencipe<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>li Sig.ri<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Simon Laggi <em>Second</em>o Rettore,<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Nicolo della Faggia<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Lorenzo Gonzaga Cam<em>erleng</em>o<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Cav.re O[tta]vio Leoni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Lattantio Nicoli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Tomasso Chrispini<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Tomaso Campana<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Stefano Falidonii<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Iacomo Gallo<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Iacomo de Caser<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Teofilo Bigotti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Gabri[e]lle Gabrielli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>[A]loysio Votre<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Gio Brandi<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Cesare Bonetti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Fabritio Ciolli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Gio: Bat'ta Magni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ascanio Barigioni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Paolo Franchi<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Michal Angelo Guidi</p>"
